The Communication Preferences interface.

The interface is visually organized into three principal areas: the status area, the navigation/header area, and the content area:
•	Status Bar: Spanning the uppermost portion of the display from left to right:
o	Time: Displays the local time as 8:03.
o	Dynamic Island: The Dynamic Island is centered at the top of the display. A solid red circular indicator is visible toward its left side, consistent with the iOS screen-recording status indicator.
o	Connectivity & Power: The Signal Strength icon displays two active black bars and two inactive gray bars, accompanied by the adjacent network label 5GUW. On the far right, the battery icon is partially filled, displaying the numeric charge level 16 centered within the housing.
•	Navigation & Header Bar: Establishing the user's hierarchical location within the iOS environment:
o	Back-Navigation: The upper-left margin displays a back-navigation link labeled "Back" accompanied by a directional chevron.
o	Primary Heading: Centrally aligned with the menu context, rendered in bold black typography: "Communication Preferences".
•	Interface Body: Positioned immediately below the navigation bar, the primary body content begins near the upper portion of the screen, presenting the communication preferences management settings:
Under the first module:
Announcements: toggled On (green).
Explicatory text under this module: Receive Apple emails and communications including announcements, marketing, recommendations, and updates about Apple products, services and software. 
Under the second module:
Apps, Music, TV and More: toggled On (green).
Explicatory text under this module: Receive Apple emails and communications including new releases, exclusive content, special offers, and marketing and recommendations for apps, music, movies, TV, books, podcasts, Apple Pay, Apple Card, and more. 
Under the third module:
Apple News Newsletter: toggled Off (gray).
Explicatory text under this module: The best stories, picked by the Apple News editors, delivered right to your inbox.
